OL,3,APolice crack down on 'cockroach'
OL,4,Aprotest in Delhi as party says leaders
OL,5,Adetained
OL,6,
OL,7,FDozens of people, including Cockroach
OL,8,FJanta Party leader Abhijeet Dipke, have
OL,9,Fbeen detained in Delhi ahead of a major
OL,10,Fprotest, the collective says
OL,12,FParts of the city have been turned into
OL,13,Fa fortress, with tens of thousands of
OL,14,Fsecurity personnel deployed
OL,16,FThe protesters want electoral reforms
OL,17,Fand the resignation of election chief
OL,18,FGyanesh Kumar over alleged voter-list
OL,19,Fmanipulation, which the Election
OL,20,FCommission denies
OL,23,APub: 10-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
