OL,3,APolice crack down on 'cockroach'
OL,4,Aprotest in Delhi as party says leaders
OL,5,Adetained
OL,6,
OL,7,FPolice refused permission for the
OL,8,Fprotest, citing fears of a repeat of
OL,9,Fviolence seen at earlier demonstrations
OL,11,FThe CJP began as a satirical online
OL,12,Fcampaign before growing into a
OL,13,Fyouth-led movement
OL,15,FIts last major protest in July saw
OL,16,Fviolent clashes with police and forced
OL,17,FIndia's education minister to resign
